2026-06-24 03:30:37,229 [INFO]     the day) when early efficiency-ratio <= CHOP_ER_MAX (0.25) AND (first-hour
2026-06-24 03:30:37,229 [INFO]     FUT-VWAP cross-count >= CHOP_VWAP_CROSSES_MIN (3) OR first-hour range <
2026-06-24 03:30:37,229 [INFO]     CHOP_RANGE_PT_MAX (110pt)). Exits always allowed. Fails OPEN (not enough
