2026-06-24 03:30:37,232 [INFO]   + FEATURE 1 — FUT 15m VWAP cross + CONFIRMATION CANDLE (all-day).
2026-06-24 03:30:37,232 [INFO]     VWAP15_CONFIRM_ENABLED. The existing VWAP engine no longer fires on the
2026-06-24 03:30:37,232 [INFO]     cross bar alone: it now requires the cross bar (iloc[-3], body 65-86% band)
2026-06-24 03:30:37,232 [INFO]     PLUS the next closed bar (iloc[-2]) to CONFIRM in the same direction —
2026-06-24 03:30:37,232 [INFO]     same-colour candle that still closes on the same side of FUT-VWAP. Fires in
2026-06-24 03:30:37,232 [INFO]     either direction, any time in the entry window. Re-entries are governed by
2026-06-24 03:30:37,232 [INFO]     the existing momentum gate (no extra cap). check_vwap_signal().
2026-06-24 03:30:37,232 [INFO]     INTERPRETATION: "confirmation candle in same direction" = next 15m candle
2026-06-24 03:30:37,232 [INFO]     closes same side of its open (same colour) AND same side of VWAP as the
2026-06-24 03:30:37,232 [INFO]     cross. Confirmation candle has NO body-size requirement (only the cross bar
2026-06-24 03:30:37,232 [INFO]     does). If wrong, adjust _vwap15_confirm_ok().
2026-06-24 03:30:37,232 [INFO] 
2026-06-24 03:30:37,232 [INFO]   + FEATURE 2 — FUT 5m VWAP cross + S/R distance, FIXED +12 TARGET scalp.
2026-06-24 03:30:37,232 [INFO]     FUT5_SCALP_ENABLED. New engine 'FUT5VWAP'. On each closed FUT 5m bar that
2026-06-24 03:30:37,232 [INFO]     CROSSES its session VWAP (bar opens one side, closes the other) with body
2026-06-24 03:30:37,232 [INFO]     65-86% AND whose close is > FUT5_SCALP_SR_MIN_DIST (20pt) from EVERY one of
2026-06-24 03:30:37,232 [INFO]     yesterday's classic pivots S1/R1/S2/R2 → buy in the cross direction. Exit is
2026-06-24 03:30:37,233 [INFO]     a FIXED +FUT5_SCALP_TARGET_PTS (12) option points (HARDSL + 15:25 force-close
2026-06-24 03:30:37,233 [INFO]     still apply; NO trail/SMA8). One trade per event: deduped on the 5m bar ts,
2026-06-24 03:30:37,233 [INFO]     so the next entry needs a fresh qualifying cross. check_fut5m_vwap_scalp_signal().
2026-06-24 03:30:37,233 [INFO]     INTERPRETATION: ">20 points away from s1/r1/s2/r2" = min distance to ALL four
2026-06-24 03:30:37,233 [INFO]     pivots > 20pt (price in clear space, not hugging a pivot). "cross" = bar
2026-06-24 03:30:37,233 [INFO]     open & close on opposite sides of VWAP. Pivots = classic floor-trader pivots
2026-06-24 03:30:37,233 [INFO]     from the prior trading day's H/L/C. If wrong, adjust compute_classic_pivots()
2026-06-24 03:30:37,233 [INFO]     / check_fut5m_vwap_scalp_signal().
2026-06-24 03:30:37,233 [INFO] 
