2026-06-24 03:30:37,233 [INFO]     bar crosses its VWAP (body 65-86%) AND its close is > MORNING_VWAP_SR_MIN_DIST
2026-06-24 03:30:37,233 [INFO]     (20pt) from every pivot S1/R1/S2/R2 → buy in the cross direction. Re-entries
2026-06-24 03:30:37,233 [INFO]     per momentum gate. Uses engine 'VWAP' (so it inherits the VWAP option-VWAP
